    {
      "formula_id": "math:sobolev-pointwise-composition-entire-printed-proof:010",
      "source_latex": "\\begin{equation}\\label{eq:sobolev-composition-distributional-chain-rule}\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\left(f(\\bm{u}),\\frac{\\partial\\phi}{\\partial x_i}\\right)\n&=\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\left(f(\\bm{u}_n),\\frac{\\partial\\phi}{\\partial x_i}\\right)\\\\\n&=-\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\left(\\nabla f(\\bm{u}_n)\\frac{\\partial\\bm{u}_n}{\\partial x_i},\\phi\\right)\\\\\n&=-\\left(\\nabla f(\\bm{u})\\frac{\\partial\\bm{u}}{\\partial x_i},\\phi\\right),\n\\end{aligned}\n\\end{equation}",
